<title>USA: Classic Bancshares sets first qtly div.</title>
<headline>Classic Bancshares sets first qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>ASHLAND, Ky. 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Classic Bancshares Inc said it declared an initial quarterly dividend of $0.06 on its common stock.</p>
<p>The dividend will be payable on October 15 to shareholders of record on September 30.</p>
</text>
